<title>BELGIUM: EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</title>
<headline>EU molasses import duties remain suspended.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union molasses import duties are to remain suspended at zero for a further week, the sugar management committee decided on Wednesday, an EU member state offIcial said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Reflecting steady world prices, the cane cif reference price remained unchanged from last week at 8.39 Ecus per 100 kg while the cif reference price for beet fell to 12.23 Ecus per 100 kg from 12.24 Ecus last week. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
